### ✅ Step 1: Register User (Send OTP)
POST http://localhost:8000/restpractice/register/send-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "7982638458"
}

### 🔐 Step 2: Verify Registration OTP (Create User + JWT)
POST http://localhost:8000/restpractice/register/verify-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "7982638458",
  "session_id": "YOUR_SESSION_ID",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 🔓 Step 3: Login User (Send OTP)
POST http://localhost:8000/restpractice/login/send-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "7982638458"
}

### 🔑 Step 4: Verify Login OTP (Receive Tokens)
POST http://localhost:8000/restpractice/login/verify-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "7982638458",
  "session_id": "YOUR_SESSION_ID",
  "otp": "123456"
}

