### 📚 Step 7: Get All Blogs
GET http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ✍️ Step 8: Create Blog
POST http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/create/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "My First Blog",
  "content": "This is the content of my blog post."
}

### 📄 Step 9: Get Blog Details
GET http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 💬 Step 10: List Comments on Blog
GET http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/1/comments/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ➕ Step 11: Add Comment to Blog
POST http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/1/comments/add/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "content": "Nice post!"
}

### ✏️ Step 12: Edit Comment
PUT http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/1/comments/1/edit/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "content": "Updated comment content."
}

### 🗑️ Step 13: Delete Comment
DELETE http://localhost:8000/restpractice/blogs/1/comments/1/delete/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


POST /logout/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "<refresh_token>"
}
